  m_text: "<b>How to perform Ambu Bag ventilation:</b> Use  left hand to hold the
    air outlet firmly over the infant\u2019s mouth. Squeeze the Ambu bag with right
    hand\n\nDeliver <b>2 ventilations</b> per cycle before switching with the other
    player."
